Subject: CPMS I03E2 Seed Case and Mutation Operator Catalogue SJS Input Audit

@ [audit_uuid] 2a01d17a-2652-4707-bed3-969e7c5e5fcb
@ [source_uuid] 5d973a58-5672-4945-859c-cd65f9606a46
@ [source_sha256] 1803F81C635EA075CC6A86ABA516C88478ADE25287BEE7C721C2F22828164633

& [AuthorityInput] is sufficient for formation only
  + I03E1 obligation output is designed but not active or materialized
  + operator design can form statically while proposal generation remains forbidden

& [Correction1] moves exact numeric mutation out of generic JSON values
  + TOKEN_NUMBER_BOUNDARY replaces one I03B-retained numeric token span in exact bytes
  + replacement is grammar-valid exact text and faithful ingress reruns from the result
  + no serde_json Value or floating projection is used to generate or judge the token

& [Correction2] moves object-order controls to span-preserving bytes
  + BYTE_REORDER_OBJECT_MEMBERS reorders complete admitted member slices without changing key or value token bytes
  + generic parse-reserialize is forbidden as a metamorphic control because it can alter spelling and order elsewhere

& [Correction3] refines one-mutation identity
  + one primary semantic dimension changes
  + every incidental changed byte and every dependent recomputation is declared
  + coherent successor and isolated broken-relation modes remain distinct

& [Correction4] closes relation carrier
  + a relation operator declares exact carrier bytes JSON or typed fixture
  + it delegates construction to one valid layer operation and adds relation intent rather than bypassing type construction

& [Correction5] prevents automatic expectation authority
  + operator preconditions and obligation class can propose likely stage applicability
  + no expected acceptance rejection agreement or semantic result exists until exact output review

& [Correction6] separates archetype concrete seed proposal and admitted seed
  + archetype is a recipe
  + concrete seed proposal owns bytes or typed fixture identity
  + admitted seed requires reviewed expectation source and later signature

& [Correction7] qualifies set cover
  + greedy selection is deterministic planning advice and not proof of mathematical minimum
  + ties use a fully specified tuple
  + rejected candidates cause traceable recomputation and never obligation deletion

& [Correction8] closes invalid-output atomicity
  + generator output can contain deliberately invalid case bytes
  + proposal catalogue structure itself must remain valid complete and digestible
  + exhaustion or generator fault releases no partially admitted catalogue

& [Correction9] removes schema mutation from root conformance cases
  + the five canonical I02 schemas are immutable inputs and never mutation targets
  + external missing malformed and escaping reference mutations remain bounded I03A or I03D validator-profile probes
  + I03E cases may cite exact inherited profile-probe evidence but do not count those probe schemas as public-root instances

& [AuditDisposition] is source_valid_after_refinement_formation_allowed_generation_forbidden
